        <mxCell id="securitynote" value="Security controls across tiers: TLS for public API traffic · private application and data subnets · security groups and network ACLs · least-privilege IAM · secrets separated from image/configuration · CloudWatch alarms. The current S3 website demo is HTTP; do not send real wellness data until HTTPS is configured." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff8e8;strokeColor=#d6a843;fontSize=12;align=left;spacing=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="70" y="1210" width="1660" height="55" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
